id:                     E3488
trigger_tool: configure|upstream-test|consumer
phase: testing
error_signature: upstream program returns success with optional feature body excluded|binary exists but runtime feature unavailable
severity:               3
category:               configure, dependency, testing
match_keywords: optional feature,test body,compile-time exclusion,runtime capability,virtual table,consumer data oracle
title: 可选功能被编译排除时，上游进程成功不能替代功能位图和真实消费者数据
root_cause: 某些原始测试把整个测试主体包在功能宏内，禁用后仍以退出码0结束；测试注册数和进程PASS数不变，但具体能力和数据路径没有执行。存在recipe和binary并不证明消费者所需功能存在。
affected_scope: 支持可选格式、插件、SQL模块和后端的C/C++生产者及应用消费者
verification_cmd: original check_xls_load/check_zipshp guard-to-return source trace and108 original Automake IDs; current native formal r6 original108/108 zero skip, consumer20 internal assertions and Harmony1/1; exact actual load_XL/VirtualXL original-data evidence
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: bind-feature-bitmap-and-data-oracle
rec_description: 保留原始TESTS及条件分支，声明实际启用功能位图，追踪依赖构建选项并验证目标运行时能力；增加真实文件导入和模块数据读取oracle，将原上游进程数、消费者断言及启用分支分别记录，不以相同的历史N/N跨功能快照迁移。
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual
forbid_1_pattern: source count proves all features|same test count reuse old PASS|hide optional capability failure
forbid_1_reason: 功能体被排除后也可返回成功，历史进程计数不覆盖新启用的数据路径。
forbid_1_consequence: 发布形式上存在的包，却让应用的导入、虚拟表或格式处理在运行时失败。
doc_file: drafts/E16991-draft-2301.md
last_updated: 2026-10-14
source_event: Current formal predecessor disables FreeXL/MiniZIP; original check_xls_load/check_zipshp guard excludes actual bodies and still returns0; new recipe enables both, preserves108 TESTS, adds actual load_XL/VirtualXL consumers; current formal r6 target source/feature/data results completed; actual log SHA256 3955e48f35977608ff8f38ca2c2805179f19d451219884281fcd23a05f78afce; application GUI and platform release remain separate
